    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Acropalypse is a short bullet time twin-stick shooter where you murder the crops you plant. Complete orders by planting your own enemy waves. Use the power of the rocket gun to fly through the air and string together incredible combos.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acropalypse was born from a simple idea: What if a farming sim turned into a bloodbath?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Day, New Crops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you'll get a new order over the telephone, telling you which crops to plant and how many.\u00a0You'll have to pace yourself as you balance fighting foes and planting future legions. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slow Down Time Mid-Air</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grumshoo comes equipped with the legendary Compost-a-tron, allowing you to slow down time itself while airborne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Stay Airborne to Rack Up Insane Scores</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos break when you touch the ground, so stay airborne as long as you can to max out the multiplier and earn a gold medal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's like more than 14 levels!!!! (its just 15 haha) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, music, and programming sourced from broke college students like you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/b39a958e5734777b7cdf2bed2cc411dd.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Acropalypse is a short bullet time twin-stick shooter where you murder the crops you plant. Complete orders by planting your own enemy waves. Use the power of the rocket gun to fly through the air and string together incredible combos.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acropalypse was born from a simple idea: What if a farming sim turned into a bloodbath?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Day, New Crops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you'll get a new order over the telephone, telling you which crops to plant and how many.\u00a0You'll have to pace yourself as you balance fighting foes and planting future legions. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/35b66113993addd77414beafc320f57b.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slow Down Time Mid-Air</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grumshoo comes equipped with the legendary Compost-a-tron, allowing you to slow down time itself while airborne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/ab0039678eff54bb4a38ff653fe22075.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Stay Airborne to Rack Up Insane Scores</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos break when you touch the ground, so stay airborne as long as you can to max out the multiplier and earn a gold medal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.poster.avif?t=1749793655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.webm?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608910/extras/1d1da6f7f5a6ba4175eb6c92072e5c69.mp4?t=1749793655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's like more than 14 levels!!!! (its just 15 haha) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, music, and programming sourced from broke college students like you!</p>",
